{"name":"The Westseat Lamp","slug":"glyph-westseat-lamp","blurb":"On the palindrome street, Juno carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Westseat. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Westseat Lamp.","seal":"f4eb7532a8bb6ff22b7167db7bf0bb841541fc613690fabcffde5d258aec6963"}
